  "exerciseGuideDeadliftMistakes": "Rounding your back as you lower toward the floor.\nLetting the load drift away from your body on the way up.\nLeaning backward at the finish instead of standing tall with control.",
  "exerciseGuideDeadliftSource": "ACE · Deadlift",
  "exerciseGuideSquatMistakes": "Letting the knees collapse inward instead of following the direction of the feet.\nLifting the heels or losing foot support as you lower.\nForcing extra depth after you lose control or a comfortable position.",
  "exerciseGuideSquatSource": "ACE · Bodyweight squat",
  "exerciseGuideLungeMistakes": "Leaning or swaying your torso sideways during the step.\nLosing support through the front foot or letting the knee drift out of line.\nBouncing at the bottom instead of lowering and rising with control.",
  "exerciseGuideLungeSource": "ACE · Forward lunge",
  "exerciseGuidePushUpMistakes": "Letting your lower back sag or hips rise as you lower and press.\nLeading with your head instead of keeping it aligned with your torso.\nRushing repetitions until you lose your body position.",
  "exerciseGuidePushUpSource": "ACE · Push-up",
  "exerciseGuideChestPressMistakes": "Bouncing the load against your chest at the change of direction.\nArching your lower back or losing your points of contact to finish a repetition.\nBending your wrists back instead of keeping them aligned with your forearms.",
  "exerciseGuideChestPressSource": "ACE · Chest press",
  "exerciseGuideRowMistakes": "Swinging your torso to start each pull.\nRounding your back instead of keeping the position described for your variation.\nDropping the load quickly on the return.",
  "exerciseGuideRowSource": "ACE · Bent-over row",
  "exerciseGuidePullUpMistakes": "Using a kip or swing instead of pulling with control.\nShrugging your shoulders or losing torso alignment on the way up.\nDropping quickly instead of controlling the return to the start.",
  "exerciseGuidePullUpSource": "ACE · Chin-up",
  "exerciseGuidePlankMistakes": "Letting your lower back sag or raising your hips too high.\nShrugging your shoulders or losing your support position.\nHolding your breath while maintaining the position.",
  "exerciseGuidePlankSource": "ACE · Front plank",
  "exerciseGuideCrunchMistakes": "Pulling on your neck with your hands, if your variation places them behind your head.\nUsing momentum to rise instead of curling your torso with control.\nChanging your back or hip position from what the instructions for this variation describe.",
  "exerciseGuideCrunchSource": "ACE · Crunch",
  "exerciseGuideCurlMistakes": "Swinging your torso to help move the load.\nMoving your elbows forward if the variation asks you to keep them by your sides.\nLetting the load drop quickly on the way down.",
  "exerciseGuideCurlSource": "ACE · Biceps curl",
  "exerciseGuideShoulderPressMistakes": "Arching your lower back to move the load overhead.\nDropping the load instead of controlling the return.\nBending your wrists instead of keeping them in line with your forearms.",
  "exerciseGuideShoulderPressSource": "ACE · Seated shoulder press",
  "exerciseGuideLegCurlMistakes": "Arching your back or lifting your hips to help bend the knee.\nMoving your thigh when the variation asks you to keep it supported.\nLetting the resistance return without control.",
  "exerciseGuideLegCurlSource": "ACE · Lying hamstring curl",
  "exerciseGuideLegExtensionMistakes": "Increasing the range until your hip or torso has to lean.\nUsing momentum instead of extending and returning the leg with control.\nChoosing resistance that makes it hard to stay balanced and upright.",
  "exerciseGuideLegExtensionSource": "ACE · Standing leg extension",
  "exerciseGuideCalfRaiseMistakes": "Bouncing instead of lifting and lowering your heels with control.\nTurning your feet during a repetition when your variation asks you to keep them facing forward.\nUsing a range that makes you lose balance or control on the return.",
  "exerciseGuideCalfRaiseSource": "ACE · Standing calf raise",
  "exerciseGuideStepUpMistakes": "Letting your foot or ankle lose support on the platform.\nLetting your knee drift inward instead of following your foot.\nStepping down without controlling your body weight.",
  "exerciseGuideStepUpSource": "ACE · Step-up",
  "exerciseGuideGluteBridgeMistakes": "Raising your hips so high that your lower back arches.\nPushing through your back instead of extending your hips with control.\nDropping your hips quickly on the way down.",
  "exerciseGuideGluteBridgeSource": "ACE · Glute bridge",
  "exerciseGuideRomanianDeadliftMistakes": "Rounding your back instead of moving your hips backward.\nBending your knees so much that the movement becomes a squat.\nTurning your neck to look in a mirror during a repetition.",
  "exerciseGuideRomanianDeadliftSource": "ACE · Romanian deadlift technique"
